  "text": "Gold Price in the 2020s\nBetween the first (2020-01-31) and last (2026-09-25) monthly observations available for the 2020s, the LBMA gold price went from $1,584 to $4,261 — a gain of 169% — with a sampled high of $5,222 (Feb 2026) and a sampled low of $1,584 (Jan 2020).\nYears in the 2020s\n2020\n2021\n2022\n2023\n2024\n2025\n2026\nSee today's live gold price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop gold bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
